ochistic Paperspace - Actually pleasant to use, which is rarer than you&#x27;d think CoreWeave - Probably overkill for most people, but don&#x27;t quote me on that Nebius - Solid option if you need EU compliance DigitalOcean - Does what it says on the tin The Comparison Table (Your Mileage May Vary) I threw together this comparison based on my testing. Keep in mind prices change constantly and availability is a moving target: /* ---- Runpod-ish theme tokens ---- */ .rp-table { --rp-bg: #0f1116; --rp-card: #131722; --rp-border: #232838; --rp-text: #e6e8ee; --rp-dim: #a9b2c3; --rp-purple: #7c3aed; --rp-purple-2: #9f67ff; --rp-chip: #1a1f2b; --rp-row: #111521; --rp-feature: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.12); } .rp-table { margin: 24px 0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--rp-card); color: var(--rp-text); border: 1px solid var(--rp-border); box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); } .rp-table .rp-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 14px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rp-border); background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(124,58,237,0.12), rgba(124,58,237,0.0) 55%), linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)); } .rp-title { font: 600 16px/1.2 Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial; letter-spacing: .2px; } .rp-sub { color: var(--rp-dim); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; } .rp-table table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font: 14px/1.45 Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial; } .rp-table thead th { text-align: left; font-weight: 600; padding: 12px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rp-border); color: var(--rp-text); position: sticky; top: 0; background: var(--rp-card); z-index: 1; white-space: nowrap; } .rp-table tbody td { padding: 14px 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--rp-border); vertical-align: middle; } .rp-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: rg