    "content": "((a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h)=>{let i=document.documentElement,j=[\"light\",\"dark\"];function k(b){var c;(Array.isArray(a)?a:[a]).forEach(a=>{let c=\"class\"===a,d=c&&f?e.map(a=>f[a]||a):e;c?(i.classList.remove(...d),i.classList.add(f&&f[b]?f[b]:b)):i.setAttribute(a,b)}),c=b,h&&j.includes(c)&&(i.style.colorScheme=c)}if(d)k(d);else try{let a=localStorage.getItem(b)||c,d=g&&\"system\"===a?window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\").matches?\"dark\":\"light\":a;k(d)}catch(a){}})(\"class\",\"theme\",\"system\",null,[\"light\",\"dark\"],null,true,true) Products Features Marketplace Pricing Partners Company Contact Sales Vultr Blogs Latest Newsletter Search... K {\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Announcing the AMD Instinct™ MI325X Accelerator on Vultr Cloud\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-02-18T15:00:50.429Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-12-12T20:28:11.595Z\",\"image\":\"https://blogs.vultr.com/public/article-assets/Social_800x420_v2_6b049ddf89.png\",\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Vultr\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://twitter.com/Vultr\",\"https://www.facebook.com/Vultr\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/vultr\"],\"description\":\"Discover the power of the AMD Instinct™ MI325X GPU on Vultr Cloud. Ideal for AI model inference, HPC, and data analytics, with 256 GB HBM3E memory and 6 TB peak memory bandwidth.\",\"url\":\"https://www.vultr.com\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.vultr.com/_images/og/default.png\",\"caption\":\"Vultr\"}}} 18 February, 2025 Announcing the AMD Instinct™ MI325X Accelerator on Vultr Cloud Vultr is thrilled to announce the AMD Instinct™ MI325X Accelerator launch on our cloud platform! Building on the success of the AMD Instinct™ MI300X Accelerator, the AMD Instinct™ MI325X offers powerful capabilities for high-performance computing (HPC) and AI workloads, making it an ideal choice for businesses looking to supercharge their AI and data analytics applications. Unlock advanced performance with AMD Instinct™ MI325X The AMD Instinct™ MI325X GPU is designed for maximum efficiency and performance. It features: 256 GB of advanced HBM3E memory – perfect for deploying larger AI models in-memory. 6 TB of peak memory bandwidth – enables rapid data processing and reduces latency. Inference-optimized architecture – like the AMD Instinct™ MI300X, ensures accelerated AI model inference and training. This high-performance GPU allows organizations to use fewer GPUs to process the same workloads, which decreases energy consumption and boosts efficiency and sustainability. Effortless deployment with Vultr GPU Enabled Images With Vultr&#x27;s GPU Enabled Images, powered by the AMD ROCm™ open software ecosystem, getting started is fast and straightforward. You can deploy and scale your AI and HPC applications without worrying about proprietary software or vendor lock-in, ensuring complete flexibility and control over your infrastructure. Powering innovation across industries The AMD Instinct™ MI325X GPU is versatile and suitable for various use cases, including AI model inference and training, large-scale scientific computing, and data analytics. Here’s how different industries can benefit: Financial Services: Accelerate fraud detection with large-scale machine learning models that process real-time financial data. Healthcare Life Sciences: Train AI models for genomic research, helping identify disease markers across massive datasets. Manufacturing: Run complex simulations to optimize manufacturing processes and improve efficiency in industrial applications. Telecommunications: Enhance network optimization by analyzing vast amounts of traffic data with AI. Media Entertainment: Power high-end rendering for CGI, enabling animation studios to achieve faster data transfer and superior visual effects. Retail: Leverage predictive analytics on consumer behavior to create personalized recommendation engines. Get started today The AMD Instinct™ MI325X GPU is available for early access on Vultr. Ready to accelerate your AI and HPC workloads? Learn more about Vultr Cloud GPU , or contact us to get started today! Experience unparalleled performance and scalability with the AMD Instinct™ MI325X Accelerator on Vultr Cloud. Loading... Loading... More News View All Over 80,000,000 Cloud Servers Launched Products Cloud Compute Cloud GPU Bare Metal File System Object Storage Block Storage Managed Databases CDN Serverless Kubernetes Container Registry Direct Connect Load Balancers Features Regions Advanced Network Control Panel Operating Systems Upload ISO Solutions Industry Cloud One-Click Deployment Use Cases Marketplace Browse Apps Become a Vendor Resources FAQ Developers / APIs Vultr Docs Server Status Bug Bounty Promotions Solution Partners Start-Up Programs Company Our Team News Brand Assets Referral Program Creator Program Careers SLA Legal Vultr Trust Center Contact Your Privacy Choices Subprocessors Accessibility Products Cloud Compute Cloud GPU Bare Metal File System Object Storage Block Storage Managed Databases CDN Serverless Kubernetes Container Registry Direct Connect Load Balancers Features Regions Advanced Network Control Panel Operating Systems Upload ISO Solutions Industry Cloud One-Click Deployment Use Cases Marketplace Browse Apps Become a Vendor Resources FAQ Developers / APIs Vultr Docs Server Status Bug Bounty Promotions Solution Partners Start-Up Programs Company Our Team News Brand Assets Referral Program Creator Program Careers SLA Legal Vultr Trust Center Contact Your Privacy Choices Subprocessors Accessibility Contact Sales Log In Sign Up Terms of Service AUP DMCA Privacy Policy Cookie Policy © Vultr 2026 | VULTR is a registered trademark of The Constant Company, LLC. Terms of Service AUP DMCA Privacy Policy Cookie Policy requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()}); (self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]) self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[19598,[\\\"https://a