    "content": "MI300X Cloud Pricing: Compare 9+ Providers (2026) {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@graph\": [{\"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"AMD MI300X Cloud GPU\", \"description\": \"AMD\\u0027s flagship data center GPU for large-model inference.\", \"category\": \"Cloud Computing\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"AMD\"}, \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"offerCount\": \"21\", \"lowPrice\": \"0.95\", \"highPrice\": \"7.86\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"url\": \"https://getdeploying.com/gpus/amd-mi300x\"}}, {\"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Why choose the MI300X?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\\u003cp\\u003eComes with 192GB HBM3 - the largest memory of any single GPU. 5.3 TB/s memory bandwidth. Strong ROCm ecosystem for PyTorch workloads. Competitive pricing against \\u003ca href=\\\"/gpus/nvidia-h100\\\"\\u003eH100\\u003c/a\\u003e for inference.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"When is the MI300X not a good fit?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\\u003cp\\u003eROCm software ecosystem, while rapidly improving, is narrower than CUDA. Some frameworks and libraries may have limited AMD support. Multi-node training tooling is less mature than Nvidia\\u0027s.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Are MI300X prices going up or down?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\\u003cp\\u003eOn-demand pricing has increased by about 33% since May 2025, from $2.35 to $3.12/hr per GPU.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What size AI models can the MI300X run?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\\u003cp\\u003eWith 192GB of VRAM, the MI300X can usually run 70B-class models with headroom, and may handle much larger models in 4-bit quantized form depending on runtime overhead, KV cache, and context length.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How much VRAM does the MI300X have?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\\u003cp\\u003eThe MI300X has 192GB of VRAM. Multi-GPU setups increase total memory, but that memory is not automatically pooled across GPUs.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the MI300X\\u0027s memory bandwidth?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\\u003cp\\u003eThe MI300X has 5,300 GB/s of memory bandwidth. Higher bandwidth helps with faster data transfer between GPU memory and compute cores.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What data types does the MI300X support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\\u003cp\\u003eThe MI300X supports 6 precision formats. \\u003cstrong\\u003eTraining:\\u003c/strong\\u003e BF16, FP16, FP32. \\u003cstrong\\u003eInference:\\u003c/strong\\u003e FP8, INT8. \\u003cstrong\\u003eScientific:\\u003c/strong\\u003e FP64.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does the MI300X support Infinity Fabric?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. The MI300X supports Infinity Fabric with 896 GB/s of bidirectional bandwidth. This helps accelerate multi-GPU communication.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How much does the MI300X cost per hour?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\\u003cp\\u003eMI300X pricing currently ranges from $0.95/hr to $7.86/hr per GPU, depending on the provider, instance type, and billing model.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How much does the MI300X cost per month?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\\u003cp\\u003eAt 720 hours per month, one MI300X can cost between $684.00 to $5,656.77 per month, depending on the provider. Reserved and spot pricing can lower that further.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Which cloud providers offer the MI300X?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\\u003cp\\u003eThe MI300X is available from 9 cloud providers, including Cirrascale, DigitalOcean, Crusoe. Pricing and availability vary by region and billing model.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I rent the MI300X in the cloud?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. We currently track 21 MI300X listings across 9 cloud providers:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ctable\\u003e\\n\\u003cthead\\u003e\\n\\u003ctr\\u003e\\n\\u003cth\\u003eBilling type\\u003c/th\\u003e\\n\\u003cth\\u003eListings\\u003c/th\\u003e\\n\\u003cth\\u003eAvg $/GPU/hr\\u003c/th\\u003e\\n\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\n\\u003c/thead\\u003e\\n\\u003ctbody\\u003e\\n\\u003ctr\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd\\u003eOn-demand\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd\\u003e9\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd\\u003e$3.25/hr\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\n\\u003ctr\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd\\u003eReserved\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd\\u003e8\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd\\u003e$3.10/hr\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\n\\u003ctr\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd\\u003eSpot\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd\\u003e2\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd\\u003e$1.20/hr\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\n\\u003ctr\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd\\u003eCustom contract\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd\\u003e2\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd\\u003eOn request\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\n\\u003c/tbody\\u003e\\n\\u003c/table\\u003e\"}}]}]} window.plausible = window.plausible || function () { (window.plausible.q = window.plausible.q || []).push(arguments); }; show = true, 100); setTimeout(() => show = false, 5000)\" x-transition:enter=\"transition ease-out duration-300\" x-transition:enter-start=\"opacity-0 transform translate-y-8\" x-transition:enter-end=\"opacity-100 transform translate-y-0\" x-transition:leave=\"transition ease-in duration-300\" x-transition:leave-start=\"opacity-100\" x-