eptedAnswer :{ @type : Answer , text : Azure charges $7.86/hr for their ND MI300X v5 instances. This is calculated from their 8-GPU VM priced at $62.85 per hour, divided by 8 GPUs. Azure is among the most expensive MI300X providers. }},{ @type : Question , name : How much memory does the AMD MI300X GPU have? , acceptedAnswer :{ @type : Answer , text : The AMD MI300X has 192 GB of HBM3 memory, making it ideal for running large language models with 70 billion or more parameters. This high memory capacity is one of its key advantages for AI and machine learning workloads. }},{ @type : Question , name : Which cloud providers offer AMD MI300X GPUs? , acceptedAnswer :{ @type : Answer , text : AMD MI300X GPUs are available from six major cloud providers: TensorWave ($1.50/hr), Vultr ($1.85/hr), RunPod ($2.99/hr), Sesterce ($3.30/hr), Oracle Cloud ($6.00/hr), and Azure ($7.86/hr). On-demand rates as of May 2026 for U.S. regions. }},{ @type : Question , name : What is the cost to run MI300X for 2 hours? , acceptedAnswer :{ @type : Answer , text : Running an AMD MI300X GPU for 2 hours costs anywhere from $3.00 (TensorWave at $1.50/hr) to $15.72 (Azure at $7.86/hr). These are on-demand rates without any reservations or prepaid contracts. }}]}`; // === Build keywords array from BlogPostingSchema field === var keywords = []; if (blogPostingSchemaRaw) { keywords = blogPostingSchemaRaw .split(',') .map(function (k) { return k.trim(); }) .filter(Boolean); } // === Build BlogPosting JSON-LD (schema.org properties only) === var blogPostingJsonLd = { \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\", \"headline\": title, \"description\": metaDescription, \"datePublished\": publishedAt, \"dateModified\": updatedAt, \"author\": { \"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": authorName }, \"url\": slug, \"image\": thumbnailImage, \"articleSection\": tag, \"keywords\": keywords }; // === Inject JSON-LD === var s = document.createElement('script'); s.type = 'application/ld+json'; s.text