 MI300X 192 GB $2.99 Community Cloud on-demand Sesterce MI300X 192 GB $3.30 Hourly marketplace rate Vultr 8 x MI300X cluster $3.99 $31.92/hr node / 8 GPUs Oracle Cloud BM.GPU.MI300X.8 $6.00 8-GPU bare-metal ($48/hr) Azure ND MI300X v5 (8 x MI300X) $7.86 $62.85/hr VM / 8 GPUs in West US * Normalized to a single MI300X, even when only multi-GPU nodes are offered. Last update: May 1, 2026 Methodology Why you can trust these numbers: ul li strong On-demand only /strong - no reservations or prepaid contracts. /li li strong Same silicon /strong - every figure refers to AMD MI300X (192 GB) SKUs. /li li strong Public price lists /strong - pulled in May 2026 from each provider #39;s published pricing pages. /li li strong U.S. regions, USD /strong - prices elsewhere vary by 5-20 %. /li /ul Cost-performance snapshot Provider / GPU Ten-hour runtime Effective cost Thunder Compute - H100 80 GB 10 x $1.38 $13.80 Vultr - MI300X 10 x $1.85 $18.50 TensorWave - MI300X 10 x $1.50 $15.00 RunPod - MI300X 10 x $2.99 $29.90 Azure - MI300X 10 x $7.86 $78.60 Thunder Compute&#39;s H100 still delivers more runtime per dollar than most on-demand MI300X options, making it the cost-efficiency pick for prototyping and fine-tuning. Azure ND MI300X Instances Through the ND_MI300X_v5-series , Azure offers hyper-scale virtual machines designed for high-end Deep Learning training and tightly coupled, scale-up and scale-out Generative AI or HPC workloads. Powered by AMD Instinct MI300X accelerators and 4th Gen Intel Xeon Scalable (Sapphire Rapids) processors, these instances provide immense high-bandwidth memory (HBM) capacity, making it possible to fit larger LLMs into a single node with fewer GPUs. Provider SKU MI300X GPUs VCPUs RAM Hourly price Price per-GPU Azure Standard_ND96isr_MI300X_v5 8 96 1850 $48.00-$62.85 $6.00-$7.86 Why this matters for developers ul li strong More memory, new math /strong - MI300X packs 192 GB HBM3 and FP8 support, ideal for 70 B+ parameter models. /li li strong Price gap vs. H100 /strong - Even Vultr #39;s single-GPU MI300X at $1.85/hr costs about 34% more than Thunder Compute #39;s H100 at $1.38/hr. /li li strong H100 still wins ROI /strong - Unless your model truly needs 192 GB or FP8, an H100 80 GB at $1.38/hr often delivers better value. /li li strong Bookmark this page /strong - we refresh the numbers monthly so you don #39;t have to. /li /ul Get the world&#x27;s cheapest GPUs Low prices, developer-first features, simple UX. Start building today. Book a Demo Get started Pages Home About Pricing Contact Status Resources Templates Blog Documentation Careers Others Referral Students Sub-processors Legal Terms Conditions Privacy Policy Cookie Policy Loading... (function() { // ASCII frames - make sure this is properly defined const frames = [` ++++++++++++++\\` ;++; ;++. .+++ .++. \\`++++++ .++. .++++++++;\\` ;+++++++++++ +++++++++; ++ **************. +**; +**; .*** .**; \\`***+** ;**; .**********+ +*********** +**********. ;** **************. +**; +**; .*** .**; \\`***.**. ;**; .************\\` +*********** +***********. .***. ;**+ +**; +**; .*** .**; \\`*** *** ;**; .*** .+**** +**+ +**; .**** \\`****+ .**+ +**; +**; .*** .**; \\`*** +**. ;**; .*** \\`***. +**+ +**; *** ****** .**+ +**; +**; .*** .**; \\`*** **+ ;**; .*** ;**+ +**+ +**; *** +******\\` .**+ +**; +**; .*** .**; \\`*** *** ;**; .*** *** +**+ +**; *** ;*******; .**+ +***++++++***; .*** .**; \\`*** +**; ;**; .*** *** +***+++++++. +**; \\`*** .********+ .**+ +************; .*** .**; \\`*** **+ ;**; .*** *** +**********. +***;;;+****\\` \\`********** .**+ +************; .*** .**; \\`*** +** ;**; .*** *** +**********. +*********. +**********. .**+ +**+\\`\\`\\`\\`\\`\\`+**; .*** .**; \\`*** ;**+ ;**; .*** *** +**+\\`\\`\\`\\`\\`\\`\\` +**********; ;***********+ .**+ +**; +**; .*** ;**; \\`*** *** ;**; .*** *** +**+ +**+.....;**+ .************* .**+ +**; +**; \\`*** ***. \\`*** +**\\` ;**; .*** +**+ +**+ +**; *** \\`**************\\` .**+ +**; +**; ***. \\`***\\` \\`*** .